<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL: TRIA ALFA GOES EX-RIGHTS.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL: TRIA ALFA GOES EX-RIGHTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of textiles firm Tria Alfa</p>
<p>will trade ex-rights on Thursday, the Athens stock</p>
<p>exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>The terms of the rights issue are one new registered</p>
<p>ordinary share for every five outstanding at 1,200 drachmas.</p>
<p>Tria Alfa will issue 105,000 shares, the bourse said.</p>
<p>					     Adjusted opening price</p>
<p>    Tria Alfa common			    1,908 dr</p>
<p>    Tria Alfa preferred			 2,152 dr</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
